				table_id: 2245246540467579945L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Dust to Dust"
			x: 3.25d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5You know what? Nevermind. They found a world that feels almost as single tone as Abyss."
				""
				"&dEh, it feels a bit better to me. Grey tones and macabre creatures are a lot better than blood blood, eyeballs, blood, guts, etc etc."
				""
				"&5Fair. Keep your Night Vision handy, lights barely help here Bandit."
