				"&dNot registering any ores. Maybe its just the darkness the FOP wants to research."
				""
				"&5Could be. The creatures here seem to drop piles of Darkly Powder, a strange shadowy magical dust. "
				""
				"&dBunch of things you can make with it it looks like. I'd grab a bunch of it, Bandit, most likely will need it soon."
