		{
			title: "The Unliving Place"
			x: 0.5d
			y: 2.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&5Greckon feels a bit like Abyss in it being a single theme, but its not nearly as run into the ground."
				""
				"&dGreckon's world slot is reserved for worlds that are haunted. Ghosts, ghouls, undead. The once living themselves aren't quite as interesting to the FOP..."
				""
				"&5...but the ecto energy of these worlds suffuses into the ground itself and creates some strong materials."
				""
				"&dGetting to Greckon is no easy task. You'll want to grab yourself a Blank Realmstone, and some Nightmare Flakes in the Abyss. "
				""
				"&5Then go summon the Abyss boss Elusive. You'll need to Right Click the Nightmare Flakes on the ORIGINAL Elusive, not a clone, to create the Greckon Realmstone."
			]
			dependencies: ["2F85F104F5FA32CB"]
			id: "1E155D00D0E02D7A"
			tasks: [{
