		{
			title: "Gig Session"
			x: 8.25d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5The boss...or well, bosses of Dustopia are known as the Primordial Five."
				""
				"&dThey were once a band sponsored by the FOP, then managed by the FOP, and in the end, indebted to the FOP for saving them."
				""
				"&5Even though it was the FOP that caused them to fall. They saw the old days through rose tinted sunglasses, not realizing the truth that they succeeded before the FOP ever stepped in."
				""
				"&dThe FOP took advantage of that. Utilized them and their devoted fanbase. And eventually...they became so in debt they couldn't refuse the FOP digitizing them and making them control Dustopia for them, land of darkness."
			]
			dependencies: ["3A8F194B457A1FDA"]
			id: "337107726FD40F8D"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2944C38129128915"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Getting the Band Back Together"
			x: 10.75d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5Each member of the Ancient Ones band became one of the Primordial Five bosses. Promises of the FOP reuniting their band kept them going. "
				""
				"&dAnd each time they are summoned to fight a Power User, they were able to stay and jam for a bit before returning to the darkness until next time."
				""
				"&5So, this is a quandry, Bandit. Unlike most of the FOP Game Server bosses, these ones arent... bad. But to continue, you are GOING to need that Boss Card..."
				""
				"&dWe'll figure out something, Bandit. Gather up some Darkly Powder though, either way I think you'll need a bunch of it..."
			]
			dependencies: ["337107726FD40F8D"]
			id: "196984E67524FD40"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7EDCAA6BAB80F78E"
				type: "item"
