			description: [
				"&5Bribing the Primordial Five shouldn't be difficult. But we think helping them as well would be a good idea."
				""
				"&dSo we came up with an idea to help them be together as a band more. It's quite simple : Give them all sorts of instruments and musical things."
				""
				"&5They only get to meet once in a while, and without instruments. So bringing them instruments and some music gear should help them until the system can be changed."
				""
				"&dThe most difficult things will probably be the music discs. I know there used to be a way that involved skeletons and creepers, but otherwise loot chests should have them if you explore enough."
