		{
			title: "Clone Conundrum"
			x: 8.25d
			y: 2.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5The Boss of Greckon, Bane, used to be a very prominent inventor for the FOP. "
				""
				"&dStarted to research into cloning. Made some good progress apparently, except that any clones of sentient creatures went..."
				""
				"&5...a bit mad. Their logic and reasoning would eventually go out the window and they'd go dangerously insane."
				""
				"&dWe thought he had been fired at one point for cloning a FOP Board Member, but it looks like he was actually transfered into the FOP Game Server. Interesting."
			]
			dependencies: ["2F1EAA9113565453"]
			id: "4CF5DF2F72560A76"
			tasks: [{
				id: "26B71A07874A02D2"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Getting a bit Sus..."
			x: 10.75d
			y: 2.5d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5Now I'm pondering if this is the real Bane, or a clone that survived and took his place before being put into the Game Server, yeah?"
				""
				"&dNot sure we'll ever know, ya know? Well, I guess it doesn't really matter, either way you need to get past Bane, Bandit."
				""
				"&5Hm, you'll need to make him a trophy to get his attention. You'll need to make some Primed Ghoulasm for it."
				""
				"&dLook for Haunted Mazes. You can find a Haunting Table there, and just Right Click a Ghoulasm to \"Prime\" it. "
				""
				"&5Bane probably put those up to test the 'smartness' of Power Users that want to fight him..."
				""
				"&dA maze for intelligence...yeah that sound a bit mad. Well, you can use that Primed Ghoulasm to make a Haunted Idol for Bane."
			]
			dependencies: ["4CF5DF2F72560A76"]
			id: "4561CE2D73DC7B68"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "45F2FA2DD8786311"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:haunted_idol"
				}
				{
					id: "360CFD28321FB365"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:primed_ghoulasm"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "04D7B3F769A4AAE5"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2245246540467579945L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Double Trouble"
			x: 12.25d
			y: 1.75d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&5Facing Bane means, of course, facing his clones."
				""
				"&dIt's how he got his nickname of The Haunter. He likes using clones to watch subordinates, spy on enemies, and trick anyone giving him trouble."
				""
				"&5Just keep that in mind as you summon him. Which is easy, just toss that Haunted Idol out, and he'll come running for the award."
				""
				"&dAs you fight him, he'll spawn different sized clones to take hits and distract you, while he occasionally goes invisible to dodge."
				""
				"&5Manage to defeat him, and he might drop some haunted gear."
			]
			dependencies: ["4561CE2D73DC7B68"]
			id: "0ED7B519D7831D40"
			tasks: [{
				id: "37C967EF92882513"
