		{
			title: "Recognition"
			x: 12.25d
			y: 3.25d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS BRIBE"
			description: [
				"&dThe path to Bane's heart is his pride. "
				""
				"&5One of the reasons we thought he quit was because he didn't win the Nobel Prize for his clone research. "
				""
				"&dHe went silent after the award for that year was announced. Even the FOP stopped putting him into corp news."
				""
				"&5Looks like he was working in silence. The loss of that (and many other) awards stung his pride. Which is still a trouble for him to this day."
				""
				"&dSo to convince him, you'll need to award him with a variety of prizes. As well as celebrations with fireworks. "
				""
				"&5And have statues built... It's not gonna be easy, you'll have to get into the Buddy Card game to make the big prizes for him. Good luck with that..."
			]
			dependencies: ["4561CE2D73DC7B68"]
